// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

#define Base        0
#define Nav         1
#define Sym         2
#define Fun         3
#define Game        4
#define Gameplus    5

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        Enter {
            bindings = <&kp ENTER>;
            key-positions = <8 7 6>;
        };

        WindowLeft {
            bindings = <&kp LG(LS(LEFT_ARROW))>;
            key-positions = <20 21>;
            layers = <0 1 2>;
        };

        WindowRight {
            bindings = <&kp LG(LS(RIGHT_ARROW))>;
            key-positions = <31 30>;
        };

        TabForward {
            bindings = <&kp LC(TAB)>;
            key-positions = <33 34>;
            layers = <0 1 2>;
        };

        TabBack {
            bindings = <&kp LC(LS(TAB))>;
            key-positions = <33 32>;
            layers = <0 1 2>;
        };

        EnterLeft {
            bindings = <&kp ENTER>;
            key-positions = <2 1 3>;
            layers = <0 1 2>;
        };

        TabClose {
            bindings = <&kp LC(W)>;
            key-positions = <32 33 34>;
            layers = <0 1 2>;
        };

        GamingLayer {
            bindings = <&tog 3>;
            key-positions = <33 36>;
        };
    };

    macros {
        nn: nn {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp RA(TILDE) &kp N>;
            label = "NN";
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base";
            bindings = <
            &kp Q           &kp W       &kp E                 &kp R             &kp T        &kp Y          &kp U        &kp I                &kp O            &kp P
            &hm LEFT_GUI A  &hm LALT S  &hm LEFT_CONTROL D    &hm LEFT_SHIFT F  &kp G        &kp H          &hm RSHFT J  &hm RIGHT_CONTROL K  &hm RIGHT_ALT L  &hm RIGHT_GUI SEMI
&kp ESCAPE  &kp Z           &kp X       &kp C                 &kp V             &kp B        &kp N          &kp M        &kp COMMA            &kp DOT          &kp SLASH           &kp APOS
                                        &mt LEFT_CONTROL DEL  &lt 1 TAB         &kp SPACE    &kp BACKSPACE  &lt 2 TAB    &kp MINUS
            >;
        };

        Nav {
            display-name = "Nav";
            bindings = <
        &kp ESCAPE  &kp F2   &kp HOME        &kp F6          &kp PAGE_UP        &kp NUMBER_7  &kp NUMBER_8  &kp NUMBER_9  &kp NUMBER_0     &trans
        &kp F11     &kp F5   &kp END         &kp UP_ARROW    &kp PAGE_DOWN      &kp NUMBER_4  &kp NUMBER_5  &kp NUMBER_6  &kp KP_PLUS      &kp KP_DIVIDE
&trans  &kp F4      &kp F12  &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW    &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp KP_MULTIPLY  &kp KP_MINUS   &trans
                             &trans          &trans          &trans             &trans        &trans        &trans
            >;
        };

        Sym {
            display-name = "Sym";
            bindings = <
        &kp GRAVE             &trans  &trans  &kp ASTERISK              &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS         &kp AMPERSAND  &kp ASTERISK  &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &trans
        &kp RA(NUMBER_2)      &trans  &trans  &kp LA(LC(LEFT_BRACKET))  &kp LA(LC(RIGHT_BRACKET))    &kp DOLLAR     &kp PERCENT   &kp CARET             &kp MINUS              &trans
&trans  &kp NON_US_BACKSLASH  &trans  &trans  &kp LA(LC(APOS))          &kp LA(LC(NON_US_HASH))      &kp EXCL       &kp AT        &kp HASH              &kp EQUAL              &trans  &trans
                                      &trans  &trans                    &trans                       &trans         &trans        &trans
            >;
        };

        Gaming {
            display-name = "Game";
            bindings = <
                &kp Z             &kp Q  &kp C  &kp E     &kp R     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                &kp TAB           &kp A  &kp W  &kp D     &kp F     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp LEFT_CONTROL  &kp X  &kp S  &kp V     &kp B     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                         &mo 4  &kp LALT  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Gaming+ {
            bindings = <
        &kp ESC  &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp T    &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9  &kp F10  &trans
        &kp L    &trans        &trans        &trans        &kp G    &kp F4  &kp F5  &kp F6  &kp F11  &trans
&trans  &trans   &kp I         &trans        &kp O         &kp P    &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &kp F12  &trans  &trans
                               &trans        &kp N         &kp M    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
